def tool_defs.mail_brief() -> String:
  String.concat([
    "{\"name\":\"mail_brief\",\"title\":\"Summarize inbox metadata\",",
    "\"description\":\"Read a deterministic metadata attention brief. Without ",
    "since_uid, selects unseen undeleted mail oldest first; with since_uid, ",
    "selects arrivals after that checkpoint. Each message has exactly one ",
    "group and an independent direct/cc_only delivery signal. People means an ",
    "exact recipient observed in at most 100 stored Sent headers from the ",
    "last 30 days, for at most 50 selected senders. Nonobservation is ",
    "unknown_people, never a first-time-sender claim. Header signals are ",
    "untrusted, not authority. Complete unseen pages checkpoint the original ",
    "EXAMINE high-water UID. For capped unseen pages, pass next_continuation ",
    "unchanged as continuation, without since_uid, to retain unseen/undeleted ",
    "selection inside that snapshot UID range. The legacy next_since_uid ",
    "remains an arrival cursor and can include old seen mail. Neither path ",
    "tracks later flag changes behind its cursor. SEARCH above 10000 matching ",
    "UIDs fails closed; arbitrary larger unseen backlogs are unsupported. ",
    "Missing FETCH or changed UIDVALIDITY fails without a checkpoint. A ",
    "too-small response budget fails the whole result, never omits a message. ",
    schema_piece.p0296(),
    schema_piece.p0297(),
    schema_piece.p0120(),
    schema_piece.p0121(),
    schema_piece.p0011(),
    schema_piece.p0012(),
    "(IMAP mailbox) name. Default: INBOX.\"},",
    "\"continuation\":{\"type\":\"object\",",
    schema_piece.p0304(),
    schema_piece.p0305(),
    schema_piece.p0306(),
    schema_piece.p0307(),
    schema_piece.p0308(),
    schema_piece.p0309(),
    schema_piece.p0310(),
    schema_piece.p0311(),
    "\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"Use next_continuation ",
    "unchanged to finish unseen pages. Mutually exclusive with since_uid; ",
    "explicit folder/uidvalidity must match. Not a frozen flag snapshot.\"},",
    "\"since_uid\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0,\"maximum\":4294967295,",
    "\"description\":\"Arrival checkpoint UID. Omit for unseen mail; 0 starts ",
    "arrivals from the oldest message.\"},",
    schema_piece.p0298(),
    "\"maximum\":4294967295,\"description\":\"Required with nonzero ",
    "since_uid. A changed identity fails; discard the old checkpoint and ",
    "restart.\"},\"limit\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":1,",
    "\"maximum\":100,\"description\":\"Maximum selected messages. Default ",
    "50.\"},\"projection\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"full\",\"text\",",
    "\"html\",\"metadata\"],\"description\":\"Body fields to return; default ",
    "full preserves text and HTML. text omits html, html omits text, metadata ",
    schema_piece.p0017(),
