def tool_defs.mail_flag() -> String:
  String.concat([
    "{\"name\":\"mail_flag\",\"title\":\"Flag messages\",",
    "\"description\":\"Flag messages (add \\\\Flagged). With a colour, also ",
    "set exactly that Apple Mail colour's $MailFlagBit0-2 keywords and clear ",
    "the others (red has none); without one, the current colour is kept. With ",
    "a colour the result has colour_kept: true; false when a message shows ",
    "other flags or PERMANENTFLAGS says a change lasts only for this session ",
    "(colour_not_kept lists those UIDs); or \\\"unverified\\\" when the ",
    "server sent no PERMANENTFLAGS or no flags for a message. flags lists ",
    "each changed UID's flags as the server reported them after the change ",
    "(null if it reported none). If the change stops once a store was ",
    "acknowledged or sent unanswered (or the TLS helper is lost after ",
    "starting), the call fails with partial: true, listing the acknowledged ",
    "changes and those that may have run unanswered; a retry is idempotent ",
    "but may fail again on a server that refuses the colour keywords. A ",
    "change that stopped before any store could run, or whose UIDs none ",
    "exist, is a plain error.\",\"inputSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",",
    schema_piece.p0012(),
    schema_piece.p0364(),
    schema_piece.p0365(),
    schema_piece.p0418(),
    schema_piece.p0419(),
    schema_piece.p0378(),
    schema_piece.p0379(),
    schema_piece.p0380(),
    "\"colour\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"red\",\"orange\",\"yellow\",",
    "\"green\",\"blue\",\"purple\",\"grey\"],\"description\":\"Flag colour. ",
    "Omit it to keep the current colour.\"},\"dry_run\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",",
    schema_piece.p0424(),
    schema_piece.p0425(),
    schema_piece.p0426(),
    schema_piece.p0427(),
    schema_piece.p0428(),
    schema_piece.p0429(),
    schema_piece.p0430(),
    schema_piece.p0431(),
    "false.\"}},\"required\":[\"uids\",\"uidvalidity\"],",
    schema_piece.p0008(),
    schema_piece.p0009(),
    schema_piece.p0002(),
    schema_piece.p0003(),
    schema_piece.p0432(),
    schema_piece.p0433(),
    schema_piece.p0434(),
    schema_piece.p0435(),
    schema_piece.p0436(),
    schema_piece.p0437(),
    schema_piece.p0098(),
    schema_piece.p0396(),
    schema_piece.p0397(),
    schema_piece.p0398(),
    schema_piece.p0348(),
    "\"flagged\":{\"const\":true},\"flags\":{\"type\":\"array\",",
    schema_piece.p0010(),
    schema_piece.p0347(),
    schema_piece.p0438(),
    schema_piece.p0439(),
    "\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"colour\":{\"type\":\"string\"},",
    "\"colour_kept\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"boolean\"},",
    "{\"const\":\"unverified\"}]},\"colour_not_kept\":{\"type\":\"array\",",
    "\"items\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0}}},\"required\":[\"ok\",",
    "\"folder\",\"changed\",\"missing\",\"flagged\",\"flags\"],",
    schema_piece.p0098(),
    schema_piece.p0416(),
    schema_piece.p0413(),
    schema_piece.p0423(),
    schema_piece.p0415(),
    schema_piece.p0295()])

