def tool_defs.mail_delete() -> String:
  String.concat([
    "{\"name\":\"mail_delete\",\"title\":\"Permanently delete messages\",",
    "\"description\":\"PERMANENTLY delete messages (\\\\Deleted + UID EXPUNGE ",
    "of exactly these UIDs). Cannot be undone; prefer mail_trash. Requires ",
    "confirm = \\\"permanently-delete\\\", the folder's uidvalidity and ",
    "UIDPLUS on the server. The confirm word guards against mistakes; it is ",
    "not the user's approval, so ask the user first. With MAILBEND_TYPESAFE ",
    "on, it takes at most 50 UIDs, and Jev is first asked whether each ",
    "message should be kept: any high answer, or TypeSafe failing, blocks the ",
    "whole delete (the result has jev). A UID that did not exist when Jev was ",
    "asked is reported in missing, not deleted. Jev can only block; it never ",
    "approves a delete.\",\"inputSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",",
    schema_piece.p0012(),
    schema_piece.p0364(),
    schema_piece.p0365(),
    schema_piece.p0418(),
    schema_piece.p0419(),
    schema_piece.p0378(),
    schema_piece.p0379(),
