    schema_piece.p0380(),
    "\"body\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reply_all\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",",
    "\"description\":\"Also answer the original To and Cc. Default false.\"},",
    "\"mark_answered\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"description\":\"Default false. ",
    "After an accepted non-draft reply, store \\\\Answered on this original ",
    "folder/UID/UIDVALIDITY and read its flags back once. Reports ",
    "original_marked true, false or unverified plus original_mark_reason. A ",
    "failed or uncertain mark never changes SMTP acceptance. Never resend the ",
    "reply to retry its mark. No marking for dry runs or unaccepted sends. ",
    "True reports observed flags, not permanence beyond the session.\"},",
    schema_piece.p0550(),
    schema_piece.p0460(),
    "<name@example.com>\\\".\"},\"attachments\":{\"type\":\"array\",",
    "\"description\":\"Files to attach. Only regular files inside ",
